msgstr "Tu carta para [attendant_name] [attendant_surnames]"

#: includes/class-retreat.php:415
msgid ""
"Hello, [sender_name]:\n"
"\n"
"Thank you for the letter you wrote to [attendant_name] [attendant_surnames] for the retreat \"[retreat_name]\".\n"
"\n"
"In the end, [attendant_name] did not attend the retreat. For confidentiality and data protection reasons, we are going to destroy the digital record of your letter and the printed copy that had been prepared to be delivered.\n"
"\n"
"Your letter is attached to this email, so that you can keep it and use it again if [attendant_name] takes part in a retreat in the coming months.\n"
"\n"
"Kind regards."
msgstr ""
"Hola, [sender_name]:\n"
"\n"
"Gracias por la carta que escribiste a [attendant_name] [attendant_surnames] para el retiro «[retreat_name]».\n"
"\n"
"Finalmente, [attendant_name] no ha asistido al retiro. Por motivos de confidencialidad y protección de datos, vamos a destruir el registro digital de tu carta y la copia impresa que se había preparado para entregársela.\n"
"\n"
"Te adjuntamos tu carta en este email para que la conserves y puedas volver a utilizarla si [attendant_name] participa en un retiro en los próximos meses.\n"
"\n"
"Un saludo."

